msgid "Problem %(symbol)s was solved fastest — first accepted in %(duration)s."
msgstr "Masala %(symbol)s eng tez yechildi — birinchi AC %(duration)s ichida qilindi."

msgid "Problem %(symbol)s had the most attempts — %(attempts)d submissions."
